an></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>合并后的方差严格小于任一单通道：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{\\sigma^2} = \\frac{1}{\\sigma_V^2} + \\frac{1}{\\sigma_A^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.301em;vertical-align:-0.9795em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7959em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4065em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2935em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9795em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.301em;vertical-align:-0.9795em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7959em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4065em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2935em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9795em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这意味着两个不完美的通道融合后，估计反而比任何单一通道都更准、更稳——这是整合带来的实打实的好处。Ernst 与 Banks 的经典视觉-触觉实验证明，人脑融合视触信息的精度，几乎完美地符合这个最优公式：当实验者人为给视觉加噪声、降低其可靠性，被试的权重就随之自动从视觉转向触觉，方式与逆方差加权预测的一致。大脑因此被证明是一个近乎最优的贝叶斯估计器，这一结论直接通向<a href=\"../mechanisms-frontiers/predictive-perception-bayesian-brain\">预测性知觉与贝叶斯大脑</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"整合的前提-何时该融合\">整合的前提：何时该融合</h2><p>但大脑不能盲目融合所有信号——把远处的鞭炮声和眼前的灯光合成一个事件就荒唐了。整合受「因果推断」调制：只有当不同通道的信号在时间上接近、空间上重合、且语义上一致时，大脑才判断「它们来自同一事件」并融合；否则就分开处理。麦格克效应正需要声画时间同步；腹语术也只在木偶嘴动与说话同步时才起效，一旦时序错开几百毫秒，俘获就瓦解。这说明融合本身也是一个推断：先估计「是不是同一个源」，再决定融合还是分离，整套逻辑与<a href=\"../psychophysics/signal-detection-theory\">信号检测论</a>中的统计决策一脉相承。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在全-hub-中的位置\">在全 hub 中的位置</h2><p>多感觉整合是本 hub 从「单通道」走向「统一系统」的枢纽。前面各章把视觉、听觉、化学觉、体感拆开来讲它们各自的编码（如<a href=\"audition\">听觉</a>的声源定位、<a href=\"chemical-somatosensory\">化学觉与体感</a>的风味合成），本篇则说明大脑如何把这些频道协商成一个现实。而它揭示的「逆方差加权 = 贝叶斯最优」，又恰是下一章预测编码框架在跨通道层面的具体形态——可靠性高的信号（小方差）权重大，正对应预测编码里「精度高的预测误差」被赋予更大影响。多感觉整合因此是连接「感觉」与「机制」的桥。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>多感觉整合把不同感官关于同一事件的信息融合成单一知觉，具有强制性（如麦格克效应无法靠意志拆开）。</li>\n<li>整合按可靠性加权：空间任务视觉常主导（分辨率高），时间任务听觉常主导，谁精度高谁权重大。</li>\n<li>最优整合遵循逆方差加权（贝叶斯），融合后方差小于任一单通道；Ernst-Banks 实验证明人脑近乎最优。</li>\n<li>整合受因果推断调制：仅当信号时空接近、语义一致时才融合，否则分离——融合本身也是一次统计决策。</li>\n<li>多感觉整合是从单通道走向统一系统的枢纽，其逆方差加权直接对应预测编码的精度加权，连接感觉与机制两部分。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多感觉整合","id":"多感觉整合"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"经典现象：整合的三个证据","id":"经典现象-整合的三个证据"},{"level":2,"text":"最优整合：贝叶斯与逆方差加权","id":"最优整合-贝叶斯与逆方差加权"},{"level":2,"text":"整合的前提：何时该融合","id":"整合的前提-何时该融合"},{"level":2,"text":"在全 hub 中的位置","id":"在全-hub-中的位置"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"化学觉与体感","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/sensation-perception/other-senses-multisensory/chemical-somatosensory"},"next":{"title":"注意与知觉","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/sensation-perception/mechanisms-frontiers/attention-and-perception"}}